# Move a return to refunded

- A new return starts as requested {#starts-requested}
  e.g. a return a customer has just submitted -> its status reads requested
- Support approves a return that is still requested {#approve-from-requested}
  e.g. a requested return -> approving it leaves the return approved
- Support refunds a return only once it has been approved {#refund-after-approval}
  e.g. refunding a return that is still requested -> refused with "Only an approved return can be refunded"
- Each step happens once {#each-step-once}
  e.g. approving a return that is already approved -> refused with "A approved return cannot be approved"

